# Built assets are COMMITTED. They are produced locally with `npm run build`
# and shipped in the repo, so the deploy script does not need Node on the
# server. Rebuild and commit whenever anything under resources/ changes, or
# production keeps serving the previous bundle.
#
# /public/build          <- deliberately NOT ignored
# .env.production        <- deliberately NOT ignored; VITE_* only, all public
